    "detailed_description": "<strong>Adrenaline Fueled Chaos</strong><br>Take a journey through a dangerous world where humanity is on the verge of extinction. Following a catastrophic event caused by a malicious corporation's experiments, the remnants of civilization survive in fortified junkyard enclaves. Take on missions. Engage in a never-ending battle with hordes of enemies across different environments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854620/extras/7657423dd64957dd8f2108588096543b.poster.avif?t=1754741225\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854620/extras/7657423dd64957dd8f2108588096543b.webm?t=1754741225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854620/extras/7657423dd64957dd8f2108588096543b.mp4?t=1754741225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story mode<br></li><li>Complete challenging missions enriched with special tasks<br></li><li>Salvage materials from the remnants of civilization<br></li><li>Destroy thousands of zombie hordes<br></li><li>Face off and defeat monstrous bosses<br></li><li>Upgrade your vehicle and weapons to change the course of the world<br></li><li>Beautiful isometric pixel art</li></ul>",
